comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-13T11:21:09.608Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: current request-specific searches and open/in_progress inventories plus the strict all-status corpus found no owner for a missing host script argument. Full live pm-suhxny and pm-9rgaal confirm the supported CLI entrypoint and SDK lineage. Public Node-e collector control fails on b80427b5d because the requested consent mutation never occurs; preserve unrelated completed entrypoint and reentrancy fixes."
  "2026-10-13T11:35:20.600Z","harness:codex","Independent public-wrapper control fails on b80427b5d: the requested config mutation is absent because missing host argv[1] reaches a string consumer. Supply an internal pm script label without modifying process.argv. The identical embedded collector now performs the mutation, preserves host argv/exit status, and exports no revoked-consent span. Current124 focused checks, typecheck, unchanged CodeFactor complexity, graph/record assurance,336 bounded mutants with329 killed and7 documented equivalents, and9 packed npm/Bun/npx/bunx package workflows pass. Distribution19,961,330 bytes remains below20,000,000 with the unchanged40-package runtime inventory. Final full hosted coverage remains required after the local lifecycle timeout."
